    "detailed_description": "In <strong>Time Avarice</strong>, time is both your enemy and ally. Your goal is to destroy crystals to gain time, but beware, letting them disappear will cost you. Each stage offers the chance to buy power-ups, shaping a unique gameplay experience with every run. Use the time you've earned to select different power-ups, each choice impacting your journey.  When the clock runs out, time's up.<br><br>Unlock new tiers of power-ups through repeated play, enhancing the depth and replayability of each run into this arcade-inspired space humble roguelite.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Main Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Time is a critical resource: Manage it wisely by destroying crystals and choosing power-ups.  Don't get greedy!<br></li><li> Varied runs: Different power-ups available in each playthrough allow for diverse strategies.<br></li><li> Unlockable power-up tiers: Repeated play unlocks more options, adding variety to your game.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >There is no escape, just a higher score</h2>",
